description:
I was very surprised at the final price of this uncut sheet. The one that just sold on Goldin was not mine and I was not the winner of it. This sale(if paid for) set a public record for Pokemon uncut sheets, by far. Full-sized authentic Japanese Pokemon uncut sheets are much more scarce than their English counterparts.  I have only ever owned 2 and this particular sheet is the only one I currently have. Counting the two auctioned @goldinco, and others that have popped up over the years, I come up with less full sheets than fingers on my hand.  While the number is staggering when compared to what we have seen historically, it dos not come as a complete surprise. I was not a bidder on this for anything even close to the final bid, so there at minimum 2 other bidders out there who fought for this way more than I. 

@goldinco can you please let us know if this is paid for?

#pokemon #pokémon #originalpokemon #charizard #shinypokemon
